    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00901",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "瞧，又错了！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Look, wrong again!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00901",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "再靠左！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Farther to the left!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00901",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "……这样走下去，要笔直走到村落里面去喽……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "... If we keep going like this, we will head straight into the village ...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00901",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "已经翻越了三个小山似的沙丘，可亮光却一点没有凑近……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "We had already crossed three dune-like little hills, but the light had not come any closer at all ...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00901",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "简直像在同一个地方来回兜着圈子。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It was almost as if we were circling around the same place.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00901",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "汗水流到眼里……脚停了一下，呼吸困难。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Sweat ran into my eyes ... my feet stopped for a moment, and I struggled to breathe.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
